<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Thank you for your interest in Arizona State University! I highly encourage you to review ASU’s nursing website, as there are a few options for completing your BSN at ASU.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">These options include:&nbsp;</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><ul><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Traditional Prelicensure</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Post-Baccalaureate BSN</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Online RN to BSN</span></li><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Concurrent Enrollment Programs.&nbsp;</span></li></ul></div><div><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Details about the course requirements for each can be reviewed <a href="https://nursingandhealth.asu.edu/degree-programs/undergraduate/nursing-bsn">online</a>.&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">If you have additional questions about the requirements for these programs, please contact the nursing department directly at&nbsp;</span><a href="mailto:nursingandhealth@asu.edu" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">nursingandhealth@asu.edu</a><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"> or 602-496-0937.</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;">Sincerely,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>